									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<ol outputclass="callout" id="e05252">
				<li>
					<ul id="e05253">
						<li>
							<p>The front fog lamp can be aimed as the same manner of the head lamps aiming.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>With the front fog lamps and battery normal condition, aim the front fog lamps.</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>To aim the front fog lamp up or down, turn the driver clockwise or counterclockwise.</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ol>
			<sectiondiv><ph>Operation</ph>
				<ol id="e05254">
					<li>
						<p>Turn the low beam on without driver aboard.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>The cut-off line should be projected in the cut-off line shown in the picture.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>When aiming the low beam, vertical aiming should be adjusted after adjusting the horizontal aiming.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>Disengage the parking brake and put the gear in N (Neutral), in addition, if headlamp leveling device is equipped, adjust the headlamp leveling device switch to '0'.</p>
					</li>
				</ol>
			</sectiondiv>
		</section>
